Create an environment-variable template containing placeholder names only.
Add appropriate migrations or data-preservation steps where required.
Add tests for critical authorization and transaction flows.
List incomplete work and external dependencies.
Do not mark a feature complete simply because its UI exists. It must have a working, authorized implementation or be explicitly marked as pending.
Proceed to integrate the requirements in Scripts 2–5 into this same project.
BEXORA MASTER BUILD SCRIPT 2 OF 5
AUTHENTICATION, MARKETPLACE, LISTING MANAGEMENT AND MONETIZATION CLASSIFICATION
Implement these requirements as part of the unified BEXORA project defined in Script 1.
1. REGISTRATION AND LOGIN
Create a polished registration and authentication system.
Registration fields:
Full name.
Unique username.
Phone number.
Email address.
Optional referral code.
Password.
