| Item | Amount |
|---|---:|
| Accepted deal amount | ৳100 |
| Buyer fee | ৳5 |
| Buyer pays in total | ৳105 |
| Seller fee | ৳5 |
| Seller receives | ৳95 |
| Platform earns from buyer fee | ৳5 |
| Platform earns from seller fee | ৳5 |
| Total platform commission | ৳10 |

The accepted bid remains ৳100.

The buyer must be told clearly that the accepted bid is ৳100 and that a separate platform fee of ৳5 applies, resulting in a total payment of ৳105.

The seller must be told clearly that the accepted deal price is ৳100 and that a separate platform fee of ৳5 is deducted from the seller's proceeds, resulting in a net payout of ৳95.

The platform must never label ৳105 as the accepted bid amount.

